{
 "飛び込む": "غَاصَ (To swim under water.) / غَطْسَ, يقفز الى الماء (To jump into water head-first.)  [to dive]\nمثال: 少年は水の中に飛び込んだ。\n→ The boy jumped into the water. / [to burst in ; to barge in]",
