 "飛ぶ": "ذُبَابَة, دبان (Especially, any of the insects of the family Muscidae, such as the common housef) / طَارَ (to travel through air) / طار (to travel through air)  [to fly]\nesp. 飛ぶ\nمثال: 飛行機は山の上を飛んだ。\n→ The plane flew over the mountain. / قَفَزَ (To propel oneself rapidly upward, downward and/or in any horizontal direction su) / قَفْزَة (An instance of propelling oneself upwards.)  [to jump]\nesp. 跳ぶ\nمثال: 君はどのくらい高く跳べますか。\n→ How high can you jump? / ترشيش, طرطشة (To splash (someone or something) with small droplets.)  [to spatter] / عَجَلَة (A rushed action.) / أَسْرَعَ, اِنْدَفَعَ (To do things quickly.)  [to hurry]\nمثال: 彼女は良い知らせを持って学校から家にとんで帰ったあの秋の日のことを考えた。彼女はリレーチームの選手に選ばれたのだった。\n→ She thought of the fine autumn day when she had rushed home from school with the good news; she was chosen to be on the relay team.",
