 "食えない": "حَاذِق (Showing clever resourcefulness in practical matters.) / نَاصِح, نَبِيه (Artful, tricky or cunning.)  [shrewd] / [inedible ; uneatable] / [unable to support oneself ; unable to keep body and soul together]",
