 "駆けつける": "اِنْدَفَعَ, أَسْرَعَ (To hurry; to perform a task with great haste, often not properly or without thin) / سَمَار (The stem of such plants used in making baskets, mats, the seats of chairs, etc.)  [to rush (someplace)]\nمثال: 彼女は急いで彼の病床へ駆けつけた。\n→ She came hurrying to his bedside.",
