 "１つ": "وَاحِد, وَاحِدَة (The number represented by the Arabic numeral 1; the numerical value equal to tha) / اَلْمَرْء (Any person (applying to people in general).)  [one]\nمثال: １つが通り過ぎたかと思うと、すぐに次の台風が接近する。\n→ No sooner has one typhoon passed than the next one approaches. / [for one thing]\noften used in itemized lists\nمثال: 一つには、私は貧しいし、それにまた忙しくもある。\n→ For one thing, I am poor; for another, I am busy. / وَحِيد (1. alone in a category) / فَقَط (Without others or anything further; exclusively.) / فَقَط (No more than; just.) / فَقَط (Introduces a clause with negative polarity, often one which upsets the listener')  [only]\nafter a noun / مُسَطَّح, مُنبَسِط (Flat and level.) / أَمْلَس, سَوِيّ (Without great variation.) / زَوْجِيّ (Of an integer, divisible by two.) / حَتَّى (In reality (used to imply an extreme example in the case mentioned).)  [(not) even]\nwith a verb in negative form\nمثال: 妻の死の知らせを聞いてもまゆ一つ動かさなかった。\n→ He did not even raise an eyebrow at the news of his wife's death.",
