 "１時": "اَلسَّاعَة اَلْوَاحِدَة (The start of the second hour of the day; 1:00 a.m. (01:00).)  [one o'clock]\nمثال: 誰かから電話があったら一時に戻るといって下さい。\n→ If anyone should phone, say I will be back at one o'clock. / مَرَّةً, مَرَّةً وَاحِدَةً (One and only one time.) / بِمُجَرَّد أَنّ (As soon as; when; after.)  [once]\nمثال: 彼は一時ここに住んでいた。\n→ He lived here for a time. / [for a time ; for a while]\nin weather forecasts, indicates that a given condition will hold for less than one quarter of the forecast period\nمثال: 霧のために、交通は一時不通になっている。\n→ Due to the fog, traffic is temporarily suspended. / وَقْت (A duration of time.) / مَرَّة, مرة (An instant of time.) / وَقْت (An instant of time.) / حِين, وَقْت (A ratio of comparison (see also usage notes and prepositional sense at 'times').)  [a time]",
