 "１歩": "خُطْوَة, خَطْوَة (An advance or movement made from one foot to the other; a pace.) / خَطْوَة (A print of the foot; a footstep; a footprint; track.) / قِيَافَة, مِشْيَة (A gait; manner of walking.)  [(a) step]\nمثال: もう一歩も歩けないよ。\n→ I can't walk another step. / مُسْتَوًى (A distance relative to a given reference elevation.) / مُسْتَوًى (Degree or amount.) / مَرْحَلَة (One of several discrete segments of a game, generally increasing in difficulty a)  [level]\nمثال: 両者は解決に向かって一歩踏み出した。\n→ Both parties took a step towards a solution. / [small degree ; small amount]\nمثال: もう一歩努力すれば、彼はうまくいっただろうに。\n→ With just a little more effort, he would have succeeded.",
